Package: genoCompaR
Title: Utilities for Comparing Chinook Salmon Genotype/Haplotype Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bryan", "Nguyen", email = "Bryan.Nguyen@water.ca.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reading, comparison, and quality-control utilities for wide-format
    genotype/haplotype call sheets such as those produced for Chinook salmon
    GT-seq panels. Provides pairwise sample comparison with match-rate
    statistics and bi-directional Mendelian incompatibility screening for
    parentage checks, dataset-wide duplicate ("matchy pair") detection, and
    missingness summaries.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    tibble,
    utils,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
